  triage:title "Missing compatibility matrix tests for CompatibilityVerdict admission" ;
  triage:description "Sprint doc's 'Required validation' section explicitly requires compatibility matrix tests covering: release mismatch, schema mismatch, HTTP-major mismatch, same-major minor/patch interoperability. None exist in this diff. git grep compatibility_verdict -- '*.rs' outside test/impl files returns zero test hits. The only #[test] functions in runtime_health.rs (shutdown-step bounding, heartbeat-cache eviction) do not touch compatibility_verdict at all. Confirmed by 3 reviewers (arch-qa, rust-best-practices-agent, req-qa) plus quality-mgr's own grep, independently, after correcting an initial stale-worktree false-positive round." ;
